---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Committees — DRCA" active="committees">
  <p class="eyebrow">Get involved</p>
  <h1>Committees</h1>
  <p class="lede">Committees are where the DRCA's actual work happens — and every one of them wants
  more neighbors at the table.</p>
  <div class="grid" style="margin-top:1.25rem">
    <div class="card"><h3>Land Use</h3>
      <p>Reviews every zoning change, SUP, and development proposal that touches Del Ray, meets with
      applicants and neighbors, and shapes the Association's recommendations to the city.</p>
      <p>Last Tuesday · 7:30 pm · Zoom</p><p class="em">landuse@delraycitizen.net</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Traffic Calming</h3>
      <p>Works to make Del Ray safer to walk and ride — re-formed in 2023 after members named pedestrian
      safety a top concern.</p>
      <p>Third Wednesday · Zoom</p><p class="em">tcc_chair@delraycitizens.org</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Parks / Adopt-a-Park</h3>
      <p>Keeps neighborhood parks litter-free through the city's Adopt-a-Park program — and the city
      pays the DRCA for it, funding reinvestment in the parks.</p>
      <p>First Wednesday · 7:30 pm · Zoom</p><p class="em">parks@delraycitizen.net</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Historical</h3>
      <p>Administers the Town of Potomac Historic District plaque program and connects the DRCA with
      Alexandria's historical organizations.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Membership</h3>
      <p>Grows the association — brochures, real-estate agent outreach, and membership drives at
      neighborhood events.</p><p class="em">membership@delraycitizen.net</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Start one?</h3>
      <p>Committees form where members see a need — Traffic Calming started exactly that way. Bring an
      idea to a membership meeting.</p></div>
  </div>
</Base>
